            <ArticleTitle>Idiopathic bilateral acetabular labral ossification.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>149-51</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Acetabular labral ossification is an uncommon condition. We present a case of bilateral idiopathic acetabular labral ossification with no predisposing factor. The differential diagnosis of its plain radiographic appearance is discussed.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
